.TH LOGIC 1
.SH NAME
logic \- truth-table synthesizer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/logic
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Logic
is a truth-table synthesizer.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Edit hex truth-table columns in Tk and synthesize a gate expression.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Tk fields / buttons
Edit truth table and synthesize
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/logic.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
